\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  Bought Total $4.6B In Feb  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 16:27\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds in euro figure, adds context)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--The Bank of Russia increased its foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases seven-fold in February from the previous month as it tried to slow a surging ruble, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a total of $3.5 billion and 796.42 million euros for the month--its highest volume of purchases since May 2010, the data showed. Purchases for January totaled around $646,000.\par \par \uc2 At a briefing earlier this month, first deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chairman Alexei Ulyukayev said the regulator purchased $4.5 billion for February.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out cumulative \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 --which it performs to smooth out volatility in the ruble--totalling $1.34 billion for the month, the data showed.\par \par \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  manages volatility in the ruble by keeping it in a floating corridor against a basket of euros and dollars. \b \highlight22\uc2 Interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are carried out when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  touches the upper or lower borders of the corridor.\par \par \uc2 The regulator widened the corridor to five rubles from four on March 1.\par \par \uc2 The ruble strengthened by around 3% in February, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised interest rates across the board amid accelerating inflation and increased oil-driven inflows.\par \par \uc2 -By Ira Iosebashvili, Dow Jones Newswires, +7 495 232 9195;\par \par \uc2 ira.iosebashvili@dowjones.com [ 03-09-11 1027ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020110309e739000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
