\par\par \b \uc2 Russia buys $4.6 bln to stem rouble's rise in February\b0\par\par\uc2 278 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 15:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * C.bank says bought $3.48 bln and 800 mln euros in Feb\par \par \uc2 * Rouble firmed 3.2 pct vs dlr, 2.8 pct vs basket in Feb\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, March 9 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought the most foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 10 months in February to stem gains in the rouble, which was boosted by rising oil prices, the regulator said on its web site on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 In February, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchased $3.48 billion and 796.42 million euros ($1.1 billion) to ease the upside pressure on the rouble, which firmed 3.2 percent versus the dollar <RUB=> and 2.8 percent against the euro-dollar basket <RUS=MCX>.\par \par \uc2 The figures tally with the estimate of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  first deputy chairman Alexei Ulyukayev, who said last week that the regulator bought around $4.5 billion in February.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the rouble within a floating corridor against the basket and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to buy foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the rouble closes in on the lower boundary of the band and sells dollars and euros when Russia's unit heads towards the upper boundary.\par \par \uc2 On March 1, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  widened the rouble's corridor to 5 roubles from 4 roubles and said it stood at 32.45-37.45 versus the basket. [ID:nLDE72026E]\par \par \uc2 Apart from so-called targeted \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  carries out cumulative \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it sees excessive pressure on the rouble. In February cumulative \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  totalled $1.34 billion and 405.7 million euro.\par \par \uc2 (Writing by Andrey Ostroukh; Editing by Hugh Lawson)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2 /   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110309e739000uo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
