\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Rouble recovers after airport blast, gains in sight\b0\par\par\uc2 584 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Januar 2011\par 11:25\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * Rouble firms slightly vs basket, dlr\par \par \uc2 * Reaction to airport blasts appears short-lived\par \par \uc2 * Firm oil, interest rate outlook buoyant\par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Jan 25 (Reuters) - The rouble firmed on Tuesday after short-lived weakness in reaction to a deadly blast at Russia's biggest airport, as the market's focus turned to expected interest rate hikes and sound fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 On Monday, a suicide bomber killed at least 35 and injured more than 150 people at Domodedovo airport in an attack on the capital that bore the hallmarks of militants fighting for an Islamist state in the North Caucasus region. [ID:nLDE70N1JG]\par \par \uc2 The rouble gave up earlier gains in the interbank market after news of the blast -- which came after the end of the daily \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading session on the MICEX exchange -- while stock markets extended losses. [ID:nLDE70N1SH]\par \par \uc2 Dealers said some market players preferred to minimise risks and sell the rouble and rouble assets after the attack, which \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chairman Sergei Ignatyev said would likely have little impact on the exchange rate. [ID:nLDE70N1UU]\par \par \uc2 The negative reaction appeared to be short-lived, however, and the rouble added 2 kopecks to 34.64 against the euro-dollar basket <RUS=MCX> from around 34.70 earlier and levels of 34.90 seen in the interbank market late on Monday <RUS=OTC>.\par \par \uc2 "The blast sparked a fall in the rouble as it has raised uncertainty but it has not changed the fundamentals. In the coming days, the rouble may rise to 34.50 versus the basket," said a dealer at a major Western bank in Moscow.\par \par \uc2 That level may serve as resistance for further gains in \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market by buying few hundred million dollars a day if the basket falls below 34.50 roubles, market players say.\par \par \uc2 Versus the dollar, the rouble added 3 kopecks to 29.80 <RUBUTSTN=MCX> and was flat at 40.53 against the euro after briefly touching its weakest mark so far in 2011 of 40.75 <EURRUBTN=MCX>.\par \par \uc2 "The rouble is moving in the right direction and has more room to improve", said David Karsbol, chief economist at Saxo bank.\par \par \uc2 The rouble retains support from strong oil prices [O/R] above $90 per barrel and expectations of capital inflows that may be spurred by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is seen tightening monetary policy to contain inflation.\par \par \uc2 Higher interest rates should boost a demand for the rouble by increasing its yields.\par \par \uc2 "Further rouble support ought to also come from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we expect a 25-50 basis point hike when the bank meets on Monday, Jan. 31," analysts at \uc2 Unicredit\uc2  said in a note.\par \par \uc2 The International Monetary Fund (IMF) has revised its forecast for Russia's economy growth and now sees it expanding 4.5 percent in 2011 versus 4.3 percent predicted in Oct. 2010, which is expected to play into the rouble's hands. [ID:nLDE70O0VZ]\par \par \uc2 A strong reading on Russia's industrial output in December also eased concerns about the country's fundamentals and speaks for a deposit rate hike in late January to 3.00 percent from 2.75 percent at present, Maxim Oreshkin, economist at Credit Agricole, said in a note. [ID:nLDE70N0T7] (Additional reporting by Nastassia Astrasheuskaya; Editing by Catherine Evans)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/(UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110125e71p000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
