\par\par \b \uc2 Russia cbank sold $4.8 bln, 627 mln eur in Nov\b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Dezember 2010\par 15:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Dec 7 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $4.8 billion and 627 million euros ($837 million) in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in November as it sought to avoid excessive declines in the rouble, data showed on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The data was in line with estimates from officials, who had estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold around $5 billion last month. [ID:nLDE6B0197]\par \par \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps the rouble within a floating corridor against the euro-dollar basket <RUS=MCX> and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out excessive \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves without stifling market trends altogether.\par \par \uc2 The total \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  include so-called planned sales within the band, based on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's assessment of current account and expected capital flows. These totalled $2.6 billion and 376 million euros in November, according to the data.\par \par \uc2 For each $650 million of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  accumulated on top of the planned ones, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  shifts the rouble's corridor by 5 kopecks.\par \par \uc2 Thus, the November data confirmed dealers' estimates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out three such shifts during the month, taking the corridor to 33-37 roubles against the basket from 32.85-36.85. (Writing by Toni Vorobyova; Editing by Susan Fenton)\par \par