\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Rouble ends week off 2010 lows, market puzzled by cbank\b0\par\par\uc2 710 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Oktober 2010\par 12:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * C.bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 , says moves rouble floating band * Dealers confused by c.bank's changes\par \par \uc2 * Rouble bolstered by exporters preparing for tax payments\par \par \uc2 * No clear short-term trend seen\par \par \uc2 (Adds c.bank quotes, details, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Oct 22 (Reuters) - The rouble weathered a volatile week, managing to recover from 2010 lows due to local tax payments and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however dealers say it is too early to speak of a steady trend.\par \par \uc2 The market's main focus turned to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  which recently granted the rouble more freedom by widening the floating band, but made investors wary of new positions by raising uncertainty about its current \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange policy.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board member Sergei Shvetsov said the rouble's floating range against the basket was raised by 5 kopecks after its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the last few days reached an accumulative amount of $650 million. [ID:nLDE69L0CM]\par \par \uc2 The presumed boundaries of the current corridor are at 32.85-36.85 and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to sell or buy $650 million at these frontiers before moving the band by 5 kopecks.\par \par \uc2 Market players said they were confused by the fact that the amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  needed to move the floating band is being accumulated within the band but not only on its boundaries as was the case in the spring when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would buy dollars and euros to tame the then rouble's rally.\par \par \uc2 "Everything is unclear, and again people don't understand why the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  used to buy and sell foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at its boundaries and now it refers to accumulation of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Alexander Karpov, a dealer at Zenit bank.\par \par \uc2 Later on Friday Shvetsov said the accumulation of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  is maintained over a period of several days.\par \par \uc2 "We have a counter that ticks and ticks, and once $650 millions are accumulated, we move the corridor," he said.\par \par \uc2 Right after saying this Shvetsov corrected himself, noting that the "floating corridor" is now called a "floating interval".\par \par \uc2 Shvetsov also reiterated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will gradually increase the rouble's flexibility by widening the floating interval and reducing the amount of accumulative \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  from current $650 million.\par \par \uc2 "...with the new band regime, reaching the fast moving boundaries would be possible only in a situation of extremely high and persistent imbalances between \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand and supply," Alexander Morozov, chief economist at \uc2 HSBC\uc2  in Moscow, said in a note.\par \par \uc2 "By doing so, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has made another step toward a quasi-floating \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime".\par \par \uc2 ROUBLE\par \par \uc2 The Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  wiped off all its 2010 gains, hitting earlier year lows this week against the basket at 36.31 <RUS=MCX> and at 43.13 versus the euro <EURRUBTN=MCX>, according to Reuters data.\par \par \uc2 However, it trimmed losses due to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's export-focused companies' conversion of their dollar and euro revenues to meet local quarter- and month-end tax payments.\par \par \uc2 "We have to thank the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the rouble's rebound as its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  satisfied the demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Mikhail Anisimov, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  at VTB Capital.\par \par \uc2 Against the basket, the rouble ended the week little changed at 35.77. The rouble's weekly slide against the dollar totalled 0.5 percent <RUBUTSTN=MCX>, while it posted a weekly gain of 0.7 percent versus the euro <EURRUBTN=MCX>.\par \par \uc2 On Friday alone, the rouble rose 0.86 percent versus the greenback, gained 1.23 percent against the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and firmed 1.06 percent versus the basket.\par \par \uc2 "Foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were overbought, so their Friday slide against the rouble was logical. But it's early to speak about a new real trend, we are likely to see volatile trade," said Anisimov at VTB Capital.\par \par \uc2 Artyom Roshin, a dealer at Alba Alliance bank, agreed with short-term uncertainty about the rouble's trend, adding that the first days of November after the end of month-end taxes will become a "trial for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ".\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Andrey Ostroukh, Vladimir Abramov, and Elena Fabrichnaya; Editing by Toby Chopra)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/(UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101022e6am000u5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngb