\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Rouble rises on firmer oil, more volatility seen\b0\par\par\uc2 570 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 August 2010\par 09:51\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * Rouble rises slightly, following recovery in oil prices\par \par \uc2 * Market eyes c.bank rate decision but reaction seem muted\par \par \uc2 * Activity is low, should pick up in September -- dealers\par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, details, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Aug 30 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble firmed in calm trade on Monday thanks to a rise in oil prices and risk appetite, and dealers see volatility increasing as investors start to return from summer vacation.\par \par \uc2 "The basket went lower, pricing in higher stock indexes and oil prices. But summer hibernation is still in place though Moscow's weather is already autumnal," said Sergei Romanchuk, chief dealer at Metallinvestbank.\par \par \uc2 Against the euro-dollar basket, the rouble gained 5 kopecks, or 0.15 percent to 34.44 <RUS=MCX>, closing in on the range of 33.40-34.40 where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintains so-called "target" \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , aimed at reducing upward pressure on the rouble.\par \par \uc2 The regulator sets the volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  based on oil prices and \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's current account, and usually buys some $150-200 million a day within that range, dealers say.\par \par \uc2 Prices of oil -- Russia's key export and contributor to its current account surplus -- recovered above $76 per barrel from last week's lows of around $72 per barrel [O/R].\par \par \uc2 Stock markets pointed to a pick-up in appetite towards riskier assets, with Russian benchmark RTS <.IRTS> and MICEX <.MCX> indexes adding some 0.7 percent.\par \par \uc2 But the rouble's recovery was subdued as London's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was closed for a public holiday and many investors were still on summer vacation.\par \par \uc2 "Mostly local players took part in trading today and they were pretty inactive", said Vladimir Demishev, a trader at Troika Dialog.\par \par \uc2 The volume of dollar/rouble transactions on the MICEX exchange for settlement tomorrow totalled $1.98 billion compared to average volumes of $2.5-3.5 billion.\par \par \uc2 Against the dollar, the rouble inched up 2 kopecks to 30.68 <RUBUTSTN=MCX>, well off its seven-week low of 30.97 touched last week. Versus the euro, it rose 8 kopecks to 39.00 <EURRUBTN=MCX>.\par \par \uc2 As Monday was the last day for month-end tax payments the rouble was set to loose support from export-focused companies converting their dollar and euro revenues to meet tax payments, analysts said.\par \par \uc2 The market is awaiting a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board meeting, which is expected to take place on Tuesday, with the regulator widely expected to leave interest rates unchanged. Market players say the decision is unlikely to affect the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as it has been already priced in. [ID:nLDE67T0O4]\par \par \uc2 Dealers said volatility in the rouble was likely to increase at the beginning of the new month as investors started returning back from holiday.\par \par \uc2 "The tax period is over so it will not support the rouble further. (In September) the rouble may break out of the recent narrow range," said Demishev at Troika.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, oil prices remain supportive for the rouble and there is no evidence of massive capital outflows from Russia, said Dmitry Kharlampiyev, analyst at Petrocommerce bank.\par \par \uc2 The rouble's movement against the basket may be limited by technical support at 34.65 and resistance at 34.00, said Kharlampiyev. [ID:nLDE67T1BT] (Reporting by Andrey Ostroukh, Editing by Susan Fenton)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/(UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100830e68u000k9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
