\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  c.bank happy with  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  mechanism\b0\par\par\uc2 By Yelena Fabrichnaya   \par \uc2 494 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juni 2010\par 08:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, June 25 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is happy with its current \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mechanism and pleased that its actions have become harder to predict for the market, first deputy chairman Alexei Ulyukayev told Reuters in an interview.\par \par \uc2 "If our rules and logic is clear, that's good. And the fact that our actions have become hard to work out is also good. I think the result is quite satisfactory," Ulyukayev said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  refined its two-stage \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mechanism in April, according to dealers, and in June formally announced that some \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  are directly tied to oil prices -- a key driver for the economy and markets. [ID:nLDE6561OI]\par \par \uc2 "Our market presence is defined by two different conditions. One condition is the trade balance which is, above all, determined by the price of our exports, mainly oil. This imbalance is forecastable...we can make some predictions about balancing it in advance," Ulyukayev said.\par \par \uc2 "The second component is the capital account, which is much harder to predict."\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  tracks the rouble within a 3-rouble wide, floating corridor against the euro-dollar basket, currently located at 33.40-36.40 roubles <RUS=MCX>.\par \par \uc2 It then tries to forecast the oil price component of market imbalances and compensates with 'targeted' \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We presume a certain oil price level which is normal for our economy and we can calculate how much extra foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will come into our country if the real oil price is higher than the normal one," Ulyukayev said.\par \par \uc2 "All that excess, it turns out, pressures the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. We calculated the size of the excess over a year, divided by the number of working days in a year and came to the volume of targeted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  which we do every day, but this does not affect the exchange rate."\par \par \uc2 Since the start of the month, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought around $2 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he added.\par \par \uc2 Ulyukayev confirmed dealers' assumption that the corridor is divided into three one-rouble bands, currently located around 33.40-34.40, 34.40-35.40 and 35.40-36.40.\par \par \uc2 "In the lower one we buy (foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), in the top one we sell, and in the middle one we do nothing," he said.\par \par \uc2 If the targeted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  proves to be insufficient to hold the rouble within the corridor, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  puts such moves down to the less predictable capital account component.\par \par \uc2 In that case, as per previous statements, it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the corridor's boundary -- buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the bottom level or selling it at the top -- and allows the band to shift by 5 kopecks after $700 million of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The parameters are the same -- $700 million, 5 kopecks," Ulyukayev said. (Writing by Toni Vorobyova; Editing by Kazunori Takada)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-CBANK/ROUBLE (INTERVIEW, URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|O|OIL   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100625e66p000c9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
