\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  cbank seeks to cap oil volatility in rouble\b0\par\par\uc2 512 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juni 2010\par 15:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * "Planned \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 " renamed "target \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 "\par \par \uc2 * Target \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  within band linked to oil price\par \par \uc2 * C.bank confirms mechanism of boundary \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes from \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analyst, dealer)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, June 7 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it would tweak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to further discourage one-way oil-fuelled bets and dealers said the opaque statement was likely to cap volatility in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 The regulator said it would look more closely at oil prices -- a key driver for the rouble -- to determine the size of its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the world's largest oil producer and energy revenues cover 60 percent of its budget needs.\par \par \uc2 The regulator said it had bought $3.4 billion and 699 million euros ($835 million) in May in 'target' \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which were previously known as 'planned' \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Such \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are "directed mainly at neutralising the firm expectations of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market participants related to the changes in the rouble's exchange rate, which are formed under the influence of the external economic situation," it said.\par \par \uc2 "The volumes of the target \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are determined taking into account the dynamics of energy prices."\par \par \uc2 Thus higher oil prices -- which would normally encourage investors to bet more actively on the rouble -- would lead to higher \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the trend from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 That is in line with comments from \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's first deputy chairman Alexei Ulyukayev, who said last week that a lower trade balance -- potentially caused by lower prices for oil and commodity exports -- is a reason to consider lower \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and vice versa [ID:nLDE6531FG].\par \par \uc2 The statement chimes with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aim for more transparency as part of its long-term plan to move to inflation targeting but dealers called for more clarity.\par \par \uc2 "In the coming days, the players may behave cautiously on the market, because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has announced a change in the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  mechanism and until the details are clear, significant speculations in either directions should not be expected," said Sergei Romanchuk, dealer at Metallinvestbank.\par \par \uc2 In addition to target \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  more heavily at the boundaries of the floating corridor, which, dealers say, are currently located at 33.40-36.40 roubles against the euro-dollar basket <RUS-MCX>.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the Bank of Russia on purchases/sales of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  undertaken in excess of the set target volumes are directed at smoothing out the movements in the rouble's exchange rate which are not determined by the influence of fundamental economic factors," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 It reiterated that under the current parameters after $700 million worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the boundary of the rouble's floating band the corridor is shifted by 5 kopecks.\par \par \uc2 Including the boundary \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $4.3 billion and 1.1 billion euros in May. (Reporting by Yelena Fabrichnaya, Toni Vorobyova and Vladimir Abramov; editing by Jason Webb)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -ROUBLE/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100607e667000wq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
