axation" and "Terms and\par Conditions of the 2020 Bonds--Taxation." Unless previously redeemed, or\par purchased and cancelled, the 2015 Bonds will be redeemed at their principal\par amount together with accrued interest on 29 April 2015 and are not redeemable\par prior to that date. See "Terms and Conditions of the 2015 Bonds--Redemption,\par Purchase and Cancellation." Unless previously redeemed, or purchased and\par cancelled, the 2020 Bonds will be redeemed at their principal amount together\par with accrued interest on 29 April 2020 and are not redeemable prior to that\par date. See "Terms and Conditions of the 2020 Bonds--Redemption, Purchase and\par Cancellation."\par \par Applications have been made to the Financial Services Authority in\par its capacity as competent authority under the Financial Services and Markets\par Act 2000 (the "UKLA") for the Bonds to be admitted to the official list of the\par UKLA (the "Official List") and to the \f28 \uc2 \f2 London Stock Exchange plc\f28 \uc2 \f2   (the "\f28 \uc2 \f2 London\par Stock Exchange\f28 \uc2 \f2  ") for the Bonds to be admitted to trading on the \f28 \uc2 \f2 London Stock\par Exchange\f28 \uc2 \f2  's Regulated Market (the "Market"). References in this Prospectus to\par the Bonds being "listed" (and all related references) shall mean that the\par Bonds have been admitted to the Official List and have been admitted to\par trading on the Market. The Market is a regulated market for the purposes of\par Directive 2004/39/EC (the "Markets in Financial Instruments Directive").\par \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SEE "RISK FACTORS" FOR A DISCUSSION OF CERTAIN FACTORS TO BE CONSIDERED IN CONNECTION WITH AN INVESTMENT IN THE BONDS STARTING ON PAGE 4.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \par The Bonds have not been and will not be registered under the U.S.\par Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the "Securities Act"), or with any\par securities regulatory authority of any State or other jurisdiction of the\par United Stat