\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Russian rouble at 16-mo highs on oil, more to come\b0\par\par\uc2 660 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 April 2010\par 08:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * Rouble rallies to 16-month highs vs basket and euro\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves floating boundaries 29th time in 2 mos\par \par \uc2 * Gradual rouble gains are likely to continue\par \par \uc2 (Adds quotes, detail, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 By Andrey Ostroukh\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, April 21 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble scaled to new 16-month highs versus the basket and the euro on Wednesday, prompting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to move its floating band, and dealers said the modest appreciation was likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 Strong oil prices, attractive carry trade and Russia's current account surplus favour gains in the rouble, which are, however, limited by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  tracks the rouble moves inside a floating corridor and shifts the band by 5 kopecks after $700 million of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at each boundary.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, the rouble's oil-driven rally prompted the regulator to take the 29th such step in just over two months, bringing the band to 33.55-36.55 roubles versus the euro-dollar basket <RUS=MCX>, dealers said.\par \par \uc2 The rouble closed up 9 kopecks on the day, at 33.57 against the basket, trimming gains slightly from after touching a 16-month high of 33.54.\par \par \uc2 "The day started with the sale of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  but the upward rouble's trend went under some pressure amid the lower euros and negative dynamics in Russia's stock market," said Mikhail Spolokhov, dealer at MDM bank.\par \par \uc2 The euro's weakness on the global market pushed it down to its lowest since December 2008 versus the rouble at 38.94 <EURRUBTN=MCX>. The dollar was slightly up at 29.13 roubles <RUBUTSTN=MCX>.\par \par \uc2 The rouble retained its main support from oil prices [O/R] that returned back above $85 per barrel, ensuring money flows into Russia's export-oriented economy. ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ For a graphic comparing rouble rate and oil prices click {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://graphics.thomsonreuters.com/10/04/RU_RROIL0410.gif"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://graphics.thomsonreuters.com/10/04/RU_RROIL0410.gif}}}\uc2  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\par \par \uc2 Russian exporters and their banks also bolster the rouble by selling part of dollar and euro revenues for roubles to meet local tax payments, and that will continue next week.\par \par \uc2 Petrocommerce bank estimates tax liabilities will amount to around 250 billion roubles ($8.6 billion) until the month-end..\par \par \uc2 Economic data also favours the rouble. On Wednesday, Economy Minister Elvira Nabiullina said Russia's economy grew 4.9 percent year-on-year in March and expansion is likely to continue. [ID:nLDE63K0II]\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's request for commercial banks to close their foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  correspondent accounts brought further proof of positive developments in \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's financial system. [ID:nLDE63K1N4]\par \par \uc2 HIGHER \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Along with \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the floating boundaries the regulator maintains so-called "planned" \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the floating boundaries, which are thought to have increased last week to $250 million to 300 million a day from the previously presumed $150 million.\par \par \uc2 "An increase in planned \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  will naturally slow down the pace of the rouble's appreciation and will contribute more volatility to the main rouble \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pairs," said Dmitry Kharlampiev, analyst at Petrocommerce bank.\par \par \uc2 The rouble may reach a key technical level of 33.50 per basket this week if oil stays strong and there is a positive progress in bailout for Greece [ID:nLDE63K0CE], he said.\par \par \uc2 "We see the gradual strengthening continuing this year," said analysts at Nomura in a research note, adding near-term volatility is always possible due to changes in risk sentiment and speculations.\par \par \uc2 The volume of Russsian exporters' revenues, being converted into roubles, is likely to offset the impact of external negative newsflow, and short positions in dollar and euro seem to be overwhelming for now, dealers say.\par \par \uc2 Many players have been seen using occassion downside rouble moves to re-enter short positions in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Spolokhov at MDM said.\par \par \uc2 For a FACTBOX of key rouble's moves click [ID:nLDE63I1DR].\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/ (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|RNP    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100421e64l000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
