\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  c.bank:  \highlight22\uc2 interventions \highlight\uc2  size not set in stone\b0\par\par\uc2 161 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 April 2010\par 08:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, April 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will stick to its current mechanism of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the foreseeable future but reserves the right to change the size of each step, a senior official said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  currently shifts the rouble's floating trading band versus a euro-dollar basket by 5 kopecks <RUS=MCX> for each $700 million of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The policy is designed to smooth out excessive volatility without stifling market trends.\par \par \uc2  "In the foreseeable future, the mechanism which existed will remain. But the numbers which were aired are not a dogma. Of course, the numbers can change, but there are no plans to change the mechanism for now," Kirill Vergunov, head of domestic market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told a MICEX conference.  (Reporting by Andrey Ostroukh; Writing by Toni Vorobyova)  \par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/CBANK (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100408e648000dk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
