\par\par \b \uc2 =DJ UPDATE:Russia Central Banker:Room For More Rate Cuts-Interfax\b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Februar 2010\par 08:45\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2010, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 (Adds further Ulyukayev comments)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--Russia's current low inflation leaves room for further interest rate cuts, First Deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Alexei Ulyukayev said Thursday, Interfax reported.\par \par \uc2 "I think that that as long as the situation doesn't carry inflationary risks, it allows us to consider lowering the refinancing rate," Ulyukayev said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had cut interest rates by 425 basis points last year, bringing the refinancing rate to a record low of 8.75% in an effort to stimulate lending and turn away speculative capital.\par \par \uc2 Russian consumer prices are up 2.1% since the start of the year, compared with 3.2% in the same period last year.\par \par \uc2 Last week, First Deputy \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Gennady Melikyan said the authorities would "wait a bit and see what is going on with inflation" before cutting rates further.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has already purchased a net $2 billion in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far this month, Ulyukayev said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  saw $13 billion in capital outflow in January but was unlikely to see any outflows this month, he said.\par \par \uc2 -By Ira Iosebashvili, Dow Jones Newswires; +7 495 232 9195; ira.iosebashvili@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  -0- \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (MORE TO FOLLOW) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 February 18, 2010 02:45 ET (07:45 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020100218e62i001av\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
