\par\par \b \uc2 Russia c.bank bought net $602 mln in December\b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Januar 2010\par 13:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Jan 11 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a net $602 million in December, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the rouble's trading band as part of a policy to smooth out excessive \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility in either direction, data showed on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The net figure balances out sales of $412 million, as well as purchases of $1.014 billion.\par \par \uc2 That reflects the rouble's volatile performance in the final month of 2009, when year-end profit-taking and rising risk aversion caused periods of weakness in the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , followed by sharp rebounds sparked by recoveries in oil price and by domestic tax payments.\par \par \uc2 In December the rouble stayed within the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 35-38 floating trading band versus a euro-dollar basket <RUS=MCX>. Thus all the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  were in the so-called "planned" format, meaning they took place within the band rather than at its boundaries.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also bought 241 million euros ($345 million) in December, the data showed.\par \par \uc2 The official data was broadly in line with expectations, after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chairman Sergei Ignatyev said the regulator had both bought and sold foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in December, resulting in net purchases of around $400 million in the first 15 days of the month. [ID:nLDE5BF0CI]\par \par \uc2 In November, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought a net $7.317 billion and 745 million euros. (Writing by Toni Vorobyova; Editing by Andy Bruce)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -ROUBLE/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100111e61b000tg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
