\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  c.bank lays out rouble  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  rules\b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2009\par 17:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Sept 14 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has since August been moving the corridor within which it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to limit rouble volatility in 5 kopecks steps after each $700 million of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a document showed on Monday.\par \par \uc2 The parameters are in line with what dealers have said, but have never been officially voiced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Russia officially keeps the rouble in a 26-41 band versus a euro-dollar basket <RUS=MCX>, but on a day-to-day basis the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  works with a much smaller corridor, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out excessive volatility.\par \par \uc2 "As of the start of August, it was set that the purchases (sales) of $700 million of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  under the auspices of carrying out border \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the borders of the acceptable value of the floating corridor of the cost of the bi-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket are moved down (up) by 5 kopecks," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a draft of its monetary and credit policy, a copy of which was obtained by Reuters.\par \par \uc2 Prior to that, the border was moved after each $500 million of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The width of the floating corridor was increased to 3 roubles as of July 10, from 2 roubles previously.\par \par \uc2 The policy document also showed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sees 2009 current account surplus of $32.4 billion and a trade surplus of $67.7 billion. (Reporting by Daria Korsunskaya; Writing by Toni Vorobyova; editing by Maria Kiselyova)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/CBANK (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090914e59e00199\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
